# Nothing in this project is a build artefact - the site is plain static files
# that Netlify serves as they are. So there is no dist/, no build output and no
# node_modules here. These rules are here so that nothing unwanted gets added
# later, and so the repository stays clean if you open it in an editor.

# Secrets and local config. None of these exist in this project today; the rule
# is here so that if you ever add one it cannot be committed by accident.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
id_ed25519
.npmrc
.netrc

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Logs and caches
*.log
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.eslintcache

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The eight original screenshots below were superseded by .webp versions and
# nothing in index.html points at them any more. They are excluded to keep the
# repository lean, but they are NOT deleted from your disk - they are still
# your source files, and every .webp here was made from one of them.
#
# NOTE: images/bake-bliss-splash.png and images/komiks.webp are NOT in this
# list, on purpose. Those two are still referenced, as the fallback image for
# Bake Bliss and Komiks - if the .webp ever fails to load, the browser falls
# back to them. Excluding them would leave a 404 in the deployed site.
#
# If you ever want the originals in the repository, delete the block between
# the two lines, then:  git add -A && git commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

images/komiks-hero.png
images/mealdash-splash.png
images/bookly-splash.png
images/veganbrew.jpg
images/enrollment.jpg
images/ncst-logo.png
images/profile.jpg
images/resume-preview.jpg
